--   Original finite-cap predictable centred-square Gaussian grid has O(mesh) L2 variance
-- statement:
--   For the exact original bounded predictable postpayment Hessian and stopping mask, show the compensated-squared Gaussian grid has finite second moment and uniform O(1/(m+1)) variance via conditional Gaussian fourth moments and pairwise martingale orthogonality.
-- source:
--   One genuinely stochastic second-moment estimate needed to close gb24 from a Cauchy-Schwarz argument. No abstract replacement of the original physical process.

import Mathlib
